 MaskLinkTargets←{
⍝ Returns a Boolean with a 1 for every character of a link target "(…)" that follows a "]".
⍝ Used to keep inline markup like `==` out of URLs before `ProcessLinks` has converted the links.
     txt←⍵
     r←(≢txt)⍴0
     0=+/']('⍷txt:r
     ind←⊃,/{(⊃⍵)+⍳1↓⍵}¨'\]\([^)]*\)'⎕S(0 1)⊣txt
     r[ind]←1
     r
 }
